     "title": "Comparing and adding",
     "md": "To compare, look at the whole part first, then tenths, then hundredths: 2.5 > 2.35 because 5 tenths > 3 tenths. To add or subtract, **line up the decimal points**: 2.5 + 1.75 = 4.25. Add a zero to help: 2.50 + 1.75. Money works the same: 2.50 means two and a half units."
